# Writing style

- Almost never use em dashes (`—`) in prose, UI copy, markdown content, comments, or commit/PR text.
- Prefer commas, periods, colons, parentheses, or a simple hyphen (`-`) when a break is needed.
- Same preference for en dashes (`–`) used as sentence breaks; use them only for numeric/date ranges if needed.
